    "body": "I'm not opposed to merging this in, but I'd like to note that there seems to be some sort of disagreement between editors used by our contributors as to exactly where these gridlines should be. I feel like I've seen a *lot* of PRs where in addition to making whatever actual changes were needed in the docs, the gridlines also got randomly shifted around a little bit.\r\n\r\nI can't seem to find an example of this right now, but it would be lovely to know exactly why this keeps happening, and if there's anything we can do (add a formatter configuration file to the repo somewhere?) to stop it from happening again.\r\n\r\n(FWIW most of the issues fixed in this PR seem to be strictly from misalignments, though I'm not sure how some of them could have gotten in there except for a different formatter gone crazy).",
